{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39899","headline":"龙蛰二首 二 · 徐夤","name":"龙蛰二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休说雄才间代生，到头难与运相争。\n时通有诏徵枚乘，世乱无人荐祢衡。\n逐日莫矜驽马步，司晨谁要牝鸡鸣。\n中林且作烟霞侣，尘满关河未可行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}